3
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.710
Loodus meile.

4
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.960
Annab.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.960
Ike vett ja.

6
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.310
Metsamaad.

7
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:26.500
Tahad tüki sinist taevas järves?

8
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.685
Looduseltsa selles.

9
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.010
Vihmas kavi.

10
00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.460
Kalakeel luks.

11
00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:17.819
Mart, Mart, Mart tuleks siia,
vaata kui hea lage plats siin,

12
00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.460
