45
00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.710
Rahu rahu, rahu.

46
00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:44.590
Oh, jah, vaata,
seal on üks lagedam koht,

47
00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.000
