86
00:06:40.339 --> 00:06:42.839
Küll poisid tulevad.

87
00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.160
Minu nuga lõikab paremini.

88
00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:59.335
Ei minu nuga lõikab paremini nevat
ja see

89
00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.100
Ma teen endale mõõga.

90
00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.110
Ma teen endale ka.

91
00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.850
Ei, ma teen endale piigi.

92
00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:13.930
Mis see piik on?

93
00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.720
See on selline hästi pikk.

94
00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.220
Ma ei, nagu oda.

95
00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.780
Alad.

96
00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.530
Kuule, sa oled päris odav.

97
00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:41.490
Aga kust suunast me tulime kas,
kas sealt või.

98
00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.700
Sealt jah.

99
00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:49.040
Tead,
mille järgi ma vaatan mu päikese

100
00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.860
