196
00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.950
Oot, -oot, stopp.

197
00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:28.190
See mees ütles talle midagi
ja vaata, poiss, toobki puu alt

198
00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:31.140
